WEBVTT

00:00:03.151 --> 00:00:04.433
Your whole H2F program.

00:00:04.453 --> 00:00:05.623
In your pocket.

00:00:06.404 --> 00:00:07.704
Plan it. Train it.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.742
Select your workout format.

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:13.033
Working reps and sets.

00:00:13.053 --> 00:00:14.295
Choose your stations.

00:00:14.315 --> 00:00:15.995
Or build a circuit routine.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:18.547
Your leader sends the program. You run it.

00:00:20.401 --> 00:00:22.341
300 plus exercises.

00:00:24.628 --> 00:00:27.928
If it's too hard, there's an option to make it easier.

00:00:28.198 --> 00:00:29.814
Too easy? Make it harder.

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:31.304
Add your own, and share it.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:39.465
Hurt? Tap where it hurts. Up to three spots.

00:00:39.926 --> 00:00:43.016
Pick the injury, the side, your pain, and your phase.

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:44.621
Calm it down.

00:00:44.802 --> 00:00:45.802
Rebuild.

00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:47.386
Return to training.

00:00:47.406 --> 00:00:49.936
You get a Monday to Friday recovery week.

00:00:50.009 --> 00:00:53.969
Mobility. Strength. Stability. Low-impact cardio. And rest.

00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:58.345
Pain too high? It tells you to see a provider first.

00:00:58.469 --> 00:01:02.469
Sleep rebuilds you. Set your wake-up time, and it times your bedtime.

00:01:02.574 --> 00:01:06.459
Fuel powers every rep. Your plate matches the day's training.

00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:09.713
Mind keeps you steady, with a two-minute daily check-in.

00:01:09.733 --> 00:01:14.053
Spirit is your purpose and values. Open to every belief, or none.

00:01:14.738 --> 00:01:17.138
Leaders: see your squad. Send the plan.

00:01:19.495 --> 00:01:21.227
Earn ribbons for real work.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:24.417
109 ribbons, across nine areas.

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:27.871
Earn some again, and they gain bronze and silver stars.

00:01:27.955 --> 00:01:29.888
Today shows the one you're closest to.

00:01:29.908 --> 00:01:31.738
And some are hidden. Find them.

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:33.590
H2F Trainer.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:35.720
Plan it. Train it. Recover. Repeat.
